<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Lai Ching</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lai Ching</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lai Ching</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lai Ching</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Sawlawmawn chekhai, now arui khin dow 930 BC khe chekhai. Mami bowih mih alai kowh Jihudiuüa chowng khe dow luprak kua khin chang Te Pawi khe Jihudiuüa phatah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia mih lusa maru chownglawng uan achima natukla kownkow krawi cham khai. Chanlaira hai dawngthawnguan ahuma uowi rakowi mami bowih rui miia mih asowrma hai anikma naka uowi kown mih tatuak khai. Tawkche chanlaira hai dawngthawnguan maten hown asowrma hai anikma aia ia ka uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi achur kowi aia tek mih, “Mukuang dak kowi kowh lawnguan kowi tuak mih maru kowh chownglawng dow tawngpaw auan uowi dowi chekhai; nami dow li kung kowi kowh cham krawi iowm mih hown tatu,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nachenganchepaw aia dow naiawng khowt tekla now taingta dowi chekhai. Aia tek mih, “Tawkche achur kowi ang tek kown mih dow maiawng: Thurai kowi ringkawma hown kramah diah, now aia kowh ana pek maten chün diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng nachang kownkow Thurai thawp a-i mih chekhai,” pakhai. (12:13)</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Mukuang dak kowi: Mukuang dak kowi kowh pami dow lusa kowi kowh uowi mih chap maten kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Auan uowi dowi: Auan uowi dowi pami dow tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi pami chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Chownglawng kowi kowh auan krawi cham mih 1:1-2:26</para>
  <para style="io1">Lowra sia kowh khowm bowkta mih akhin uowi 3:1-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Chownglawng atungma iung dowi rakowi chanlaima uowi kla 3:9-6:12</para>
  <para style="io1">Pur prakowi tawng chow nauang ting kown mih miapaw tuk dowi 7:1-11:6</para>
  <para style="io1">Thurai kowi ringkawma hown kramah diah, now aia laiklow chün diah 11:7-12:14</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="s">Lusa kowi tawng chap paw asung uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Mami dow prengia pek mih kowh laiklow chekhai. Aia dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh mang chekhai, now aia kowh pa ming dow David chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" />Aia tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:2">“Tawng chap paw auan uowi dowi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:2">Lusa kowi dow tawng sia paw nik dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:2">Lusa kowi kowh uowi mih chap maten tawngpaw auan uowi dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ECC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" />Mukuang dak kowi kowh maru-uüa mih lainowmma chang lup khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:3">Tawkche naiawng khowt kawm mih tawng chow mrawkra uowi?<verse eid="ECC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />Lusa kowi dow pachowng mih chur hanow uang ta uowi pachowng iawk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:4">Nachenganchepaw lusa dow chowngchowng saksakma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />Sat paw uang lawt hanow kutplan kup reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:5">now aia lawtla reng mih rah kowi kowplan reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />Li dow mrawkphak prakowi kowhutla hanow tawngphak prakowi cham takui reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:6">naiawng hai aia dow taui lutlut krawi mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Aw maten kowi kowh tui dow sata kowi kowhawr reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:7">Nachenganchepaw sata tui dow katpaw tek dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:7">Akung kowi dow tui mih aw kowi kowplan kowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:7">now sata kowi kowplan hawr khai iawk.<verse eid="ECC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />Lusa kowi dow lowra chap mih tuak kawm tuak krat müa chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:8">nami lawnguan dow lawp reng chepaw achur uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:8">Mün khowt chow khi khowk chepaw mik mih du dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:8">now mün khowt chow ta khowk chepaw param mih du dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" />Phaw khowk mih paw naplan phaw iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:9">now changta khowk mih paw naplan changah iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:9">Mukuang dak kowi kowh uowi mih dow tawngpaw asar uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />“Mü madiah, mami dow asar chaw,” pahai maru tekah mih sia nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:10">Tawkche nami dow alai kowh a-i uowi dowi rawn hownia uowi mih chowbowt.<verse eid="ECC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" />Alai chowng kowh maru-uüa kowh laiklow mih miapaw ka tuak dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:11">now pur pra kowh nauang ta dia kown miuüa kowh laiklow paw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:11">amatni kung kowi kowh ta dia miuüa mih sak kowi natowah kown nadowi.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chanlaira paw asung uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />Ang dow prengia iung pek mih maru chekhai, now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Israeluüa luk kowi chowm mang mih chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" />Mukuang dak kowi kowh changah mih chap maten chanlaira hown nachaingah hai natasang kownkow ang tatuak khai. Naiawngün hownia lusa maru luk kowi ngarera adikma Thurai tangta pe hüah mih ang khi khai. <verse eid="ECC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" />Mukuang dak kowi kowh changah mih sia maten ang khi khai; naiawngün dow tawng sia paw auan uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawngün dow li kung kowi kowh krawi iowm mih iawng krowngchow taih chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />Takhawn khowk mih kowi dow nowng tengah dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:15">now tawngpaw uowi dowi mih chap kowi dow kaah arüa dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />Sakdawng kowi ang tatek mih, “Jerusalem marow kowi ang dowi rawn kowh rik chowm mang miuüa lak-e ang lang chanlai; ang kowh dow prengia hai chanlaira ahuma,” pakhai.<verse eid="ECC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" />Nami kung kowi dow chanlaima mih hai bualama mih, now prengia chakma mih hai thuklama mih lawnguan kowi natuk kown mih ang sangkrang khai. Naiawngün tukra nau mih paw li kung kowi cham krawi iowm mih iawng krowngchow taih pami ang tuk khai. <verse eid="ECC 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow chanlaira uang hu now sak-hiara paw tawi hu ngamlam chekhai, now prengia uang hu now akrat pusara paw tawi hu ngamlam chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="s">Lusa kowi kowh piawpara asung uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />Ang tatuak mih, “Chownglawng kowi apiaw apama hai asowrma ang sam uowi matak, tawng iawng chü,” pakhai. Tawkchedow naiawngün piawpara hai asowr paw auan uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" />Naiawng rakowi ang tatek mih, “Ren kowi paw thukra uowi lowmow; apiaw apama uowi chepaw tawngpaw mrawk dowi lowmow,” pakhai. <verse eid="ECC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Now pua khe thuklama uowi mih sowr tuk kown nau kowh atawm tukma ang kham rak khai. Mukuang dak kowi kowh uowi mih maru-uüa kowh chownglawng dow atownchow taih chekhai. Nami chownglawng kowi — chanlaima uowi mih bow, thuklama uowi mih bow — lang iung mih natukla kownkow naiawng ang chaingah khai.<verse eid="ECC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" />Kri kraingma mih lup ahuma khowk ang chang. Ang matia vüi kim paw ahuma khowk ang thawp, now grep krum paw ahuma ang thawp khai. <verse eid="ECC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" />Now aiukma mih hai asowmchow mih bakan paw ahuma ang thawpah hanow chaah auih mih singh chap maten ang chowk pe khai. <verse eid="ECC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />Now naiawngün uih singh maten kowi naia thutla tui reng kownkow ang thai pe kanh khai. <verse eid="ECC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" />Narma hai narla paw akawmma ang ran khai, now ang kim kowi kowh dia mih narma narla paw akawmma chekhai. Ang dowi rawn kowh Jerusalem kowi uowi miuüa maten lak-e paw chia hai ruapur ang kowh lang hu chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" />Kuh hai tai hown akeng pren manguüa hai pren powng manguüa kowh dawngthawnguan paw ang krawi kua khai. Nami klen kowi masiuüa hai kachakuüa meng sara ün, kachakuüa kowi napela awmrawmra kownkow changla masi mih narma ün ahuma ang tut-e uowi khai.<verse eid="ECC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />Naiawng hown ang dowi rawn kowh Jerusalem marow kowi uowi miuüa lak-e paw ang lang kri kraing chekhai. Nakhowk khe paw chanlaira mih kruitown ang reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" />Ang nau mih srui iawng ang chang khai, now pe ang awmrawmra mih chap maten ang chang khai. Ang changah mih lup maten luk kowi ang ka piawra reng chekhai. Ang kawmah mih maten kowi kowh awmrawm sung dow nami piawra towbowt chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" />Nachenganchepaw ang changah mih lup maten hai ang kawmah mih lawnguan kowi ang krawi tuakah hanow naiawngün dow tawng sia paw auan uowi dowi mih ang tuk khai. Naiawngün dow li kung kowi kowh cham krawi iowm mih iawng kangowh taih chekhai. Mukuang dak kowi kowh uowi mih chap dow tawng mih paw mrawkra uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chanlaima uowi mih paw auan uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />Nami kung kowi dow chanlaira hai bualara lawnguan kowi ang krawi tuak khai. Rik uowi mih manguüa iawng uang ta uowi mih manguüa nachang lup kown mih a-i tuk tak bow? <verse eid="ECC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Aiiu lak-e anowi lang iung; nami iawng bualama mih lak-e chanlaima mih lang iung padow ang ka tuak chowdiah. <verse eid="ECC 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow chanlaima mih maru dow aia mangla mih tiama iung mih iung dowi mih tuk mat chekhai. Tawkche thuklama mih maru dow aia mangla mih tiama iung mih iung dowi mih tuk mat dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw achur khe dow amatchi pre ia trui katsang taih; amatchi pre ia trui kowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Nami kung kowi dow ang tatek mih, “Ang kowh chownglawng paw bualama mih maru kowh chownglawng chur iawng taih lowmow nachur kown. Naiawng taih hanow maiawng khowt ang chanlai mih tawng chow mrawk? Chanlai mih paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi lowmow,” pakhai. <verse eid="ECC 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" />Bualama mih maru kowi akrama sak kowi maru towah dowi mih iawng chanlaima mih maru kowi paw akrama sak kowi maru towah dowi; akung kowi dow amatchi pre ia trui kowi maru tamata reng. Bualama mih maru kowng iawng chanlaima mih maru paw kowng reng. <verse eid="ECC 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Naiawng rakowi ang matia kowh chownglawng kowi ang uown suiah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mukuang dak kowi kowh changah mih lup maten dow ang tut-e kowmatia tatowk kawm mih iawng taih chekhai. Naiawngün dow tawngpaw auan uowi dowi mih kangowh chekhai; naiawngün dow li kung kowi kowh cham krawi iowm mih iawng krowngchow taih chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawm mih paw auan uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />Mukuang dak kowi kowh akawm kratma hown ang kramah mih uanh maten kowi ang suiah khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün uanh maten dow ang kung kowi kowh nauang ta uowi kown mih maru vüi nata towla hüah kown takla chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" />Nami maru dow chanlaima bow bualama bow mih miapaw tuk dowi. Nachenganchepaw aia dow ang kramah mih uanh maten asowrma nauang ta sun kown. Naiawng mih chownglawng paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Naiawng rakowi mukuang dak kowi kowh akawm akratma hown ang kramah mih uanh maten rakowi ang kowh sak mih lainowmma piak khai. <verse eid="ECC 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow chanlaira, prengia hai tukra hown maru chang lup reng. Tawkchedow nami kung kowi aia kowh uowi mih maten tawngpaw tawi kawm dowi mih maru vüi ta towla hüah kla chekhai. Nami paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi hai sak kowi rau müa chowtaih. <verse eid="ECC 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" />Mukuang dak kowi kowh maru-uüa kawmah kratah mih hai tuakah mih sung tawng chow mrawkra uowi? <verse eid="ECC 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" />Ni towng aia kowh lup changra kowi arau hai sak-hiara uowi; uar-e paw aia kowh saktuak mih ka tanai dowi chekhai. Nami paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />Naiawng taih hanow lusa maru-uüa vüi cha mih hai kham mih hown kowmatia lup luk kowi sak-ih mih klen kowi tawngpaw lang iung mih uowi dowi bowt. Naiawngün dow Thurai hownia kowh uang ting mih pami ang owm chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai che uang pe dowi hanow miapaw ka cha dowi hai ka piaw dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" />Thurai sak-ih iawng uowi mih maru kowi dow Thurai mih chanlaira, prengia hai awmrawmra peah reng. Maru ngakuüa kowi dow nakram dawngthawnguan hanow nakrümah kown mih lup Thurai peah khai. Tawkche akung kowi dow naiawngün dawngthawnguan mih aia sak-ih iawng uowi miuüa kowi Thurai peah khai. Naiawng kram dawngthawnguan mih paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawngün paw li kung kowi kowh cham krawi iowm mih iawng krowngchow taih chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="s">Lowra chap kowh akhin uowi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />Lowra chap kowh akhin khowm bowk taia uowi bowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:1">mukuang dak kowi kowh lup maten vüi akhin uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />Uang dia khin hai kowng khin uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:2">achowk khin hai achawi khin paw uowi.<verse eid="ECC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />Nakowngta kown mih khin hai naiungah kown mih khin uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:3">napiakta kown mih khin hai nachangah kown mih khin paw uowi.<verse eid="ECC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />Nakar kown mih khin hai naren kown mih khin uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:4">nauowila uiting uangtak kown mih khin hai naplai kown mih khin paw uowi.<verse eid="ECC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />Nakuakta hua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nakuakta hua kown </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow taphua taiua mih lawnguan kowi kowh Judauüa kowh laiuat chekhai.</char></note> kown mih khin hai nakrawi kua hua kown mih khin uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:5">tasakrau kowh tadawi kown mih khin hai tadawi dowi kown mih khin paw uowi.<verse eid="ECC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />Naka kown mih khin hai namata kown mih khin uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:6">natowah kown mih khin hai nakuakta kown mih khin paw uowi.<verse eid="ECC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />Nathekta kown mih khin hai nasownah kown mih khin uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:7">rarimma nauowi kown mih khin hai natek lai kown mih khin paw uowi.<verse eid="ECC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />Tasakrau kown mih khin hai tasui kown mih khin uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:8">natasen kown mih khin hai taking tasangma nauowi kown mih khin paw uowi.<verse eid="ECC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai pe mih lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />Chang lup mih maru aia kowh kawm rak ka tak bow? <verse eid="ECC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />Lusa maru luk kowi kowh Thurai tang pe kurdik mih ang khi khowk. <verse eid="ECC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" />Aia dow lowra chap kowi akhin khe klangiungma thawpah khai. Aia dow chowngchowng saksakma mih lawnguan kowi natukla kown mih sakkraira lusa maru sak kowi tow pe khai. Nachenganchepaw auown hownia achur pat tawng chow aia chang mih dow lusa maru tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Lusa maru chownglawng kowi dow napiaw kown mih hai asowrma nauowi kown mih lak-e iung mih tawngpaw uowi dowi mih ang tuk; <verse eid="ECC 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" />lusa maru maten dow nacha nakham kown mih hai aia kowh lup maten luk kowi nasak-ih kown. Naiawngün dow Thurai uanh iawng pek chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" />Thurai changah mih srui dow chowngchowng saksakma uowi reng; naiawngün hown dow tawngpaw ia bawng dowi chekhai, now bat paw tawngpaw ia batta dowi chekhai. Naiawng Thurai chang mih dow lusa maru mih aia kowi ringkawma hown pacham kramah lah pakowh chekhai pami ang tuk.<verse eid="ECC 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" />Kawmat kowh uowi mih srui dow alai hownia kowh uowi mih chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:15">pur pra kowh nauang phaw kown mih paw alai hownia phaw khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow phaw khowk mih paw Thurai mih plan pe phawah rengreng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bawn kowi lusa maru plan mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />Nami klen kowi mukuang dak kowi kowh uowi miuüa tut-e aiung chang rah hai tara nowm chet rah kowi paw angak tawi uowi mih ang plan khi pachap iawk. <verse eid="ECC 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" />Naiawng rakowi ang ka tuak mih, “Maru iung hai maru ngak pre ia trui kowi Thurai nachet pe tara kown, tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai tut-e dow lowra chap hai lup maten kowh khowm bowkta mih akhin uowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="ECC 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Lusa maru paw asadua iawng taih pami pacham tuk lah pakowh lusa maru kowi Thurai tüng pe amatra reng pami paw ang ka tuak khai. <verse eid="ECC 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow lusa maru luk kowi kowh phaw mih iawng asadua luk kowi paw phaw reng chekhai: Amatni dow hü sak riaria mih chowtaih, now amatni dow katsang kowng mih chowtaih. Nami pasia kowi dow lusa maru hown asadua mih tawngpaw taklowira uowi dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawng chap paw auan uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" />Lusa maru hai asadua mih arah katsang mih kowi mang reng; bawn hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai rakowi bawn chowtaih kutplan chowng iawk. <verse eid="ECC 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" />Lusa maru kowh lümla aluk prakowi pün pami hai asadua kowh lümla krawng dak kowi kup pami achima miapaw tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" />Naiawng rakowi kowmatia changah mih lup luk kowi awmrawm mih lak-e lusa maru vüi tawngpaw iung dowi bowt pami ang tatuk khai. A-i kowh kakbak dow nami towbowt, tawngplawng kowchow panow a-i kowng kung kowi dow tawng chow a-i naown kown mih miapaw nowng tek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="s">Lusa kowi tawng sia paw mrawkra uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />Lusa kowi kowh tachang nowng tachang powng mih maten ang krawi plan tang mü khai. Nowng chang powng changra kowi uowi miuüa dow kar hai mik tui hown uowi khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi peah sakklamra mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. Krawi chang nowng miuüa kowh dow kür ahuma. Nachenganchepaw nowng chang powng changra kowi uowi miuüa kowh dow akhowng mih uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat kowh sing uowi miuüa lak-e alai kowh rik kowng miuüa kaucha lang iung padow ang ka tuak khai. <verse eid="ECC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" />Tawkche naiawngün lak-e kawmat kowh uang dia dowi tak miuüa kowh kaucha lang iung. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow lusa kowi kowh lup ngak phaw mih tawi khi dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Nami klen kowi lusa kowi kowh maru aklumma uowi mih hai iuksown mih dow kimping namkhetuüa ka mih kowi irsi kowh chekhai pami ang plan khi khai. Tawkche nami paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi. Naiawngün paw li kung kowi kowh krawi iowm mih iawng krowngchow taih chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />Tawngbak mih maru tek dow, “Tawngpaw chang kown nau dowi kowh tadawi owmlowm uowi mih dow bualama chekhai. Chang lup dowi mih dow ka cha dowi rakowi akowng takla,” pakhai. <verse eid="ECC 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />Nami laiklow na nowm chepaw naia. Tawkchedow ahuma ka kown nau rakowi ahuma chang lup mih lak-e ka ditchow chepaw thaulangma uowi mih lang iung. Ahuma ka kown nau kowh chang lup mih dow li kung kowi kowh cham krawi iowm mih hown katsang chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Nami klen kowi paw mukuang dak kowi kowh uowi mih vüi tawngpaw auan uowi dowi mih ang plan khi pachap iawk. <verse eid="ECC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" />Tawngbak mih maru kowh dow chauüa paw uowi dowi, tainau paw uowi dowi, aia malowkchow taih uowi. Nachenganchepaw aia dow lainowmma chang lup khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aia kowh dawngthawnguan uowi mowr mih luk kowi katpaw sak-ih dowi chekhai. Aia kowh piawpara nuata khükhü mia vüi chow khowt pat aia chang lup? Nami paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi; akawm akrat klen kowi tawngpaw na dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />Lowk iachow uowi mih lak-e dow pre ia taiua uowi mih lang iung. Tawngplawng kowchow panow pre ia mih dow lowkkowlowk nowng takhowng chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />Pre ia khe dow lowk ia mih che tim hanow alowk mih auiua nowng krüngah kown. Tawkche lowk iachow mih maru dow lainowmma nga khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh dow akhowng mih uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Nami klen kowi pre ia dow taiua mawk hanow pik den reng. Tawkche lowk iachow mih maru dow tawng iawng chow naden kown? <verse eid="ECC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Lowk iachow mih maru dow aiachow nowng sum reng. Tawkche pre ia mih maru dow amatchi mih nanowng takhowng kown. Sum rüa mih leng dow tarai naklak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />Maru kowh prengia lai sünta kown nau dowk mih alawngtangma mih mang lak-e ngaraichow chepaw prengia chakma mih klanguüa lang iung chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" />Naiawng mih klanguüa dow mang kim kowi dia mih nadowi chepaw, kla thawng mih chepaw, now ngaraima chepaw nowng chowng mang chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Ang khi mih lawngtangma mih mang kung kowi dow nami klanguüa ta chowm mang khai, now mukuang dak kowi kowh sing uowi miuüa nami mang klanguüa kung kowi tawi krawi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />Aia krüa kowi maru akawmma uowi chepaw naia. Tawkche aia uowi dowi bowt mih khin khe dow aia changla mih lup lawnguan kowi miapaw sak kowi nata towah kown nadowi chekhai. Nami paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi. Nami paw li kung kowi kowh krawi iowm mih iawng krowngchow taih chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="s">Alenma Thurai tut-e hang takham diah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />Thurai chup kim kowi en cham kowi khe kaneu diah. Kowmatia kowh angak tuk dowi mih maru-uüa iawng chang phuchua mih lak-e nasünta Thurai lai kownkow Thurai tut-e kowkowi mih lang iung. <verse eid="ECC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" />En kowh nawr mih alenma hang pacham tek lai lah; Thurai tut-e sakkrowngma hang tek lai diah. Thurai dow mukuang kowi uowi mih chekhai, now en dow lusa kowi uowi mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh laiklow mih a-echow pana lah. <verse eid="ECC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Tuakah hu lai now tuakah mih sia uarmang kowi khi-ah reng, nami iawng dow lai hu lai now bualama mih laiklow uang lawt reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />Thurai tut-e takhamta mih sia uowi hanow takhamta iawng alenma changta diah; tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow bualama miuüa luk kowi awmrawm dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" />Takhamta hüah kowh takhamta iawng chang dowi mih iung dowi; nami lak-e dow hing takham dowi mih lang iung chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />En kowh nawr mih angak prakowi hang pacham pawla en lah. “Ang takhamta mih tawi khai,” pami uamowuüa kowi hangkow tek pe diah. Naiawng en tek hanow Thurai mih nasak-ih en kown nadowi tham, now aia mih en changah mih lup maten napiakta en kown chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />Ahuma khi uarmang mih hai ahuma tek lai mih tawngpaw asung uowi dowi. Nami lak-e dow Thurai kowi phai ringkawma hown kramah diah.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawngthawnguan anikma uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />Pren kowi nowng chang powng changra krüa kowi ngarai miuüa uowi mih en khi chepaw, now ngarai miuüa kowi chet pe tara nowm dowi mih en khi chepaw hangkow awda diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru iuk luk kowi paw aia lak-e lang iuk mih uowi tak chekhai, now amatchi pre ia trui luk kowi paw aiuk aiukma mih maru iuk uowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Nachenganchepaw lupah mih krawng natownla reng kownkow mang uowi lowk ia hanow pren vüi lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />Tangka pawisa kowi lowpa miuüa dow, “Maiawng khowt now na khowk,” pami katpaw natuak kown nadowi. Now dawngthawnguan kowi lowpa miuüa paw amatni ka mowr mih luk kowi katpaw nasak-ih kown nadowi. Naiawngün lowpa mih paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" />Dawngthawnguan uang pawng hanow nami dawngthawnguan sun mih maru paw uang pawng chekhai. Khita now awmrawm mih klen kowi dow nami dawngthawnguan iah kowh tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Chang lup mih maru dow ahuma cha chepaw a-echow cha chepaw klangiungma ia müi reng. Tawkche kureng miuüa kowi dow dawngthawnguan pe müiah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Mukuang dak kowi kowh phaw mih maiow kowi angakma mih sia ang khi lowk tak. Nami dow lusa maru lowpa dawngthawnguan mih aiamat nga müa chowtaih chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />Naiawngün dawngthawnguan dow aia kowh kun chang tawi hanow piak reng. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh chauüa vüi tawngpaw ta uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" />U mu lak hownia uang diah khe lusa maru mih tawngpaw uang pawla dowi chekhai; aia mang khe paw tawngpaw aia napawla kown nadowi. Aia kawmah mih nowm chepaw aia kramah mih sia tawngpaw aia ia pawla dowi. <verse eid="ECC 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" />Nami paw lainowmma nga mih chap chekhai. Lusa maru mih uang dia khe kowh iawng plan mang reng; amatni kowh lup dow tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi chekhai. Nami paw li kung kowi kowh cham krawi iowm mih iawng taih chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />Sak-hiara, taprüa taiiara hai kunmaraura hown kangowh iiu dawng kowi lusa maru mih sun chownglawng reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" />Nachenganchepaw lusa maru chownglawng kowi iung mih sia uowi lowk. Nami dow mukuang dak kowi kowh maru-uüa mih Thurai pe singah mowrchow mih khin kowi nacha nakham kown mih hai nachang lup kown mih kowi sak-ih mih iung hai taka pami ang tuk khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh kakbak dow nami towbowt chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" />Kurengra hai dawngthawnguan aia pe a-i mih khin khe naiawngün nasun kown mih kür paw Thurai pela a-i chekhai. A-i kowh kakbak napaw kown mih hai a-i kowh lup luk kowi naawmrawm kown mih aia pe a-i khin khai. Naiawngün dow Thurai hownia kowh uanh iawng pek chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Naiawng rakowi a-i kowh chownglawng atownchow mih lawnguan kowi a-i tuak krat dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow a-i kowh sak kowi mih pe a-i awmrawmra hanow pusama aia tow a-i khai.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="s">Chownglawng kowi piawpara uowi dowi now tawngpaw mrawk dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />Mukuang dak kowi kowh uowi mih kowi angakma mih sia ang khi pachap. Nami dow lusa maru vüi lainowmma nga chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" />Thurai mih lusa maru kowi tawngbak mih kowi dow dawngthawnguan hai ringkawra ahuma peah khai. Naiawng rakowi nami maru dow tawngpaw lakke dowi bowt chekhai. Tawkche nami maru kowi mih nami dawngthawnguan nasunla kown mih khin Thurai peah dowi; akeng mih maru chowtaih nami dawngthawnguan ta powng khai. Nami paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi. Nami paw lainowmma nga mih sia chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" />Tawngbak mih maru kowh dow chauüa uowi 100 ia chepaw naia, now aia dow ning huma singla chepaw naia. Tawkche aia chownglawng kowi piawpara uowi dowi, now tadupra iung paw tawi ka dowi chekhai. Naiawng e dow ning huma aia singla chepaw tawngpaw mrawk dowi. Nami lak-e dow akowngma uang dia mih chah lang iung chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />Aia uang dia mih dow tawngpaw auan uowi dowi chekhai. Aia dow khila lusa nowi dowi hai kala ming dowi kowi plan mang khai, now iiu dawng kowi kowplan khai. <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />Aia dow katpaw khila sat dowi hai tawngpaw tukla dowi chepaw singla miuüa lak-e lang ka thaulangra chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />Lusa kowi singla 2,000 ning chepaw chownglawng kowi ka piaw ka pala dowi hanow akowngma uang dia mih ngeuüa lak-e tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru maten dow kowng kown mih taih chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" />Lusa maru chang lup mih srui dow kowmatia mu vüi kowi taih chekhai. Nachenganchepaw lusa maru kowh sakkraira mih katpaw rim dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" />Bualama mih maru lak-e chanlaima mih maru tawng chow lang ka? Maru pur kowi tawng iawng chow amang takla mih tuk hanow ngarai mih maru kowh tawng chow maratra uowi? <verse eid="ECC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Atungma ka küng kown nau mih lak-e mik hown khi mowr mih luk kowi sak-ih mih lang iung. Ka küng kown nau mih paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi. Nami paw li kung kowi kowh cham krawi iowm mih iawng krowngchow taih chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />Lowra sia uang phaw mih alai hownia rik khowm bowkta khowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en chownglawng kowi kowh kakbak lawnguan kowi Thurai hown taüa mih tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi. <verse eid="ECC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Thurai hown taüa ngamlam asung uowi dowi ngamlam chekhai. Naiawng rakowi taüa mih tawngpaw mrawk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" />Lusa maru kowh auan uowi dowi mih chownglawng atownchow mih kowi tawng chow lang iung mih miapaw tuk dowi. Lusa maru kowh chownglawng dow atownchow taih; nami dow nim iawng alenma tama reng chekhai. Kowng kung kowi dow mukuang dak kowi tawng chow ta own mih miapaw nowng tek pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="s">Chanlaira laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />Asung khakma mih paingbawng lak-e ming iung nang iung lang iung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:1">now uang dia mih ni lak-e kowng mih ni lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Pawi kim kowi cham tawi mih lak-e uowila uiting uangtak mih kim kowi tawi mih lang iung.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow pani dowi now pani dow nakowng bowk kown mih chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:2">Naiawng rakowi bowkbowk nakowng kown mih sak kowi natowah bowk kown takla.<verse eid="ECC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />Apiaw apama uowi mih lak-e akawm akratma hown uowi mih lang iung.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow akawm akratma powm iawng uowi chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:3">sak lak kowi apiaw apama nowngia uowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Chanlaima mih maru dow kowng kown mih lawnguan kowi ahuma tuak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:4">Tawkche bualama mih maru dow naka khin iung kown mih krowngchow taih tuak reng.<verse eid="ECC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />Bualama miuüa kowh meng sünta mih tawngpaw mrawk dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:5">nami lak-e dow chanlai miuüa kowh nang klow sünta mih lang iung.<verse eid="ECC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Chuh mung sawp dow maih kowi pawk prakrak kam now lüa mit reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:6">nami iawng bualama miuüa kowh ren dow lüa rim reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:6">Nami paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />Nowng chang powng chang lup dow chanlaima mih maru kowi bualama changah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:7">bümsua dow aiungma mih maru kowi sürlawkma changah reng.<verse eid="ECC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Lowra mih lup auown lak-e achur lang iung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:8">now bawrira lak-e kunma thawngma mih lang iung.<verse eid="ECC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />Kunmaraura dow bualama miuüa sak kowi kowh uowi mih chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:9">Naiawng rakowi en kowh sak kowi alenma hangkow pe kunmarauah diah.<verse eid="ECC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />“Tawngplawng kowchow kawmat kowh chowng lak-e alai kowh chowng lang iung khai?” pami hang krawi lünta diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng krawi lünta mih dow chanlaima mih maru kowh lup nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Chanlaira dow dawngthawnguan iawng aiungma mih chap chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:11">Nami dow sing uowi mih maru-uüa vüi aiungma chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />Chanlaira dow tangka pawisa iawng maru kowi pe thaulangra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:12">Tawkche chanlaira dow nowng pe singra rakowi lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />Thurai kowh lup dow hawt pawah kaneu diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:13">aia khawnta mih dow miapaw nowng teng dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Piaw khin khe piawah diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:14">Tawkchedow lusa maru vüi Thurai tow pe piaw khin mih iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:14">akrat pusara khin paw Thurai towla chekhai pami tuakah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:14">Chownglawng kowi aiungma mih khin hai angakma mih khin hawt pawah bowk diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:14">Tawngplawng kowchow panow chownglawng kowi tawng chow naown kown mih tukah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />Ang kowh mami auan uowi dowi mih chownglawng kowi ang khi bowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:15">Anowmma mih maru dow aia kowh anowm rakowi tapiak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:15">now maru ngak dow aia kowh angak rakowi ning kawmma singla khai.<verse eid="ECC 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" />Naiawng rakowi aiungma hai chanlaima nauowi kown mih hangkow kamrüt diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:16">naiawng uowi kown kamrüt lai now kowmatia kowi tapiak mih chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" />Tawkche angakma hai abualama paw hang uowi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:17">naiawng uowi hanow akhin nadowi tak khe akowng natakla tarawng.<verse eid="ECC 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Naiawng rakowi nami lawnguan kowi pe ching kaneu diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:18">Thurai kowi ringkaw mih maru dow aiung paw angak paw achütma chang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" />Marow lowk kowi kruitown mih hamüt ia nowng chang aiung mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:19">chanlaira dow chanlaima mih maru lowk ia kowi lang nowng chang pe iungra chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" />Lusa kowi dow chang lup ngak dowi mih miapaw uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:20">atungma hing changta lup iung hüah mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Maru tek mih srui kowi hang cham pe param diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:21">cham pe param lai now en kowh nar pe en piati mih en nata tarawng.<verse eid="ECC 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en sak kowi en tuk towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:22">en matia paw maru kowi cham pe piati mih ahuma khowk chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Naiawngün ang kowh chanlaira hown ang chaingah kowh ang tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:23">“Chanlaima mih maru ang phaw ngengche kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:23">Tawkche nami dow ang hownia alakma chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" />Chownglawng kowh auan mia chow nowng tuk?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:24">Nami dow lainowmma büp khai; miapaw nowng tukah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Lowra sia natuk kown mih ang sangkrang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:25">lowra mih auan natukla kownkow ang kowh chanlaira hown ang krawi cham khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:25">Tawng rakowi chow angakma hai bualama mih maru uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:25">Nami lawnguan kowi tuk kown mih ang sangkrang khai.<verse eid="ECC 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" />Masiuüa ngak dow kowng lak-e paw nga mih ang tuk khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:26">aia kowh sakraura ka mih dow leng kowi tasowk mih iawng natasowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:26">now aia dawiah mih maru dow lawngha leng kowi tatawm mih iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:26">Maru ngakuüa dow nami masiuüa rut kowi natasowk hai natatawm kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:26">Tawkche Thurai sak-ih iawng uowi mih maru dow aia rut hownia naplai kown.<verse eid="ECC 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />Prengia pek mih tek mih, “Chownglawng kowh auan natukla kownkow ang kamrüt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:27">now naiawng ang chang mih khin khe masiuüa lawnguan kowi ditchowchi ditchowchi ang krawi tuk khai.<verse eid="ECC 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" />Akeng mih lawnguan kowi natuk kownkow ang krawi cham ngamlam khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:28">Nachenganchepaw ang krawi ka cham dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 7:28">Tawkche athawng ia maru pungmadawng kowi achinawmma mih kachakuüa dow ang khi lowk ia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:28">Nachenganchepaw nami pungmadawng kowi masiuüa tarapdow lowk ia paw ang khi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" />Mami chowtaih ang tuk khai:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:29">Lusa maru kowi Thurai thawpah mih dow achinawmma nauowi kown mih chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:29">Tawkche lusa maru mih amatni kowh tiama kowi mang bowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="s">Mang kowh laiklow chün diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />Chanlaima mih maru iawng mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:1">Lusa kowi tawng ngai chow phaw mih auan mia chow nowngia tuk?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 8:1">Chanlaira dow lusa maru-uüa kowi piaw kowh pe renah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:1">now lumowr klimma mih kowi chimprowngchow nowng chang chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />Naiawng rakowi mang kowh ana pek chün diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mang kowh laiklow nachün kown mih Thurai pur kowi en takham khowk chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" />Mang kowi nuata hanow napowtta kown mih hangkow sakkrowng diah. Now mang kowi kingküa miuüa hown hang cham tawi tabawng diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mang dow aia nau iawng nachang lup reng kown chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Mang luk kowi dow miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang khai,” pami miapaw nowng tek pe dowi. <verse eid="ECC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Aia kowh laiklow en chün mowr dow thaulangma en naia uowi kown. Chanlaima mih maru dow tawng iawng chow achang takla mih hai tawng khe chow chang e taka kown mih khin tuk chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" />Lowra chap kowh taka klowk mih akhin uowi, now lup chang krang paw taka klowk mih tiama uowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw lusa maru kowh tukra dow a-echow taih rakowi kawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" />Lusa maru dow pur prakowi tawng chow naown kown mih tuk dowi. Naiawng rakowi pur prakowi tawng chow nauang ting kown mih miapaw nowng tek a-i dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" />Li kowi dow miapaw nowng dowkah dowi. Nami powm iawng kowng khin kowi dow miapaw nowng townah dowi chekhai. Maru ngakuüa paw amatni kowh sangkrangra ngak hown kowngra hownia dow nowng taka dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai kamrütra miapaw tukah dowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" />Lusa kowi kowh maru mih lowkkowlowk tachang nowng khai. Lusa kowi kowh phaw mih maten lawnguan kowi abüpma ang tuakah khai. <verse eid="ECC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Nami klen kowi maru ngakuüa kowng mih kowi ringkawra uowima hown Thurai maru-uüa dupah mih paw ang khi khai. Kowng kung kowi dow nami maru ngak changla lup ngak mih maten marow chakuüa tamata khai. Nami paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" />Chang lup ngak mih maru kowi alenma ripah dowi hanow lusa maru kowh sak dow nachang lup ngak ngamlam kownkow tatuak ngamlam chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" />Angakma mih maru changta lup ngak 100 kat chepaw ning huma singla mih nauowi kown. Nachenganchepaw ringkawma hown Thurai kowi kram miuüa nalang ka iungra kown pami ang tuk. <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" />Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow Thurai kowi ringkawma hown kram dowi rakowi naka iungra kown nadowi, now amatni kowh chownglawng dow nim iawng alenma natama kown.<verse eid="ECC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />Now lusa kowi nowng tukah dowi mih chap plan uowi lowk tak. Nami dow maru ngakuüa kowh kakbak maru iunguüa ka, now maru iunguüa kowh kakbak maru ngakuüa ka mih chekhai. Nami paw tawngpaw auan uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" />Naiawng rakowi chownglawng kowi apiaw apama uowi diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mukuang dak kowi dow cha mih kham mih hai apiaw apama uowi mih klen kowi lusa maru vüi iung mih uowi dowi bowt chekhai. Nahanow mukuang dak kowi kowh Thurai pe mih lusa maru chownglawng kowi dow ni towng aia kowh lup luk kowi piaw mih towbowt nachowng auiua kown.<verse eid="ECC 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Ni chut uar prowt chi müi dowi kowi lusa kowi kowh phaw mih maten auan natuk kownkow ang tatuak khai. <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" />Nakhowk khe Thurai changah mih lup maten ang khi khai, now tawng chow own mih auan achima tuk mih miapaw uowi dowi pami ang tuk khai. Lainowmma a-i chanlai khowk chepaw naia. Tawkche mün khowt chow a-i chanlai hai tuk kown mün khowt chow a-i kamrüt chepaw achima a-i nowng tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="s">Maru maten kowh chur krang katsang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />Akrama hai abüpma ang krawi tuak hanow lowra luk kowi Thurai kowh dow lowra sia nowng changra uowi pami ang tuk khai. Chanlaima mih hai achinawmma mih maru-uüa hown amatni kowh lup maten Thurai luk kowi chekhai. Pur prakowi Thurai sakraura bow Thurai suira bow naka kown mih miapaw tuk dowi. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" />Maru iung chepaw, maru ngak chepaw, chang phuchua reng chepaw, chang phuchua dowi chepaw, achinawmma chepaw, asürlawkma chepaw, takham mih maru kowh paw, takham kown kram mih maru kowh paw maru maten kowh chur krang dow katsang taih chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Lusa maru luk kowi kowh phaw mih chap maten kowi lang nga mih uowi pachap mih dow maru maten kowh chur krang katsang taih mih chekhai. Lusa maru kowh sak dow thukla sangching hai tuak ngak kangowh chowtaih, now akung kowi dow kowng reng chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Sing uowi miuüa kowh dow sakowmra uowi tak. Tawngplawng kowchow panow akowngma mih krangsi lak-e dow kui sing uowi mih lang iung chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" />Sing uowi miuüa dow amatni paw kowng takla pami tuk chekhai. Tawkche kowng khowk miuüa dow tawngpaw tuk dowi bowt chekhai. Kowng khowk miuüa kowh dow awmrawm sung uowi dowi bowt; amatni kowi dow miapaw sak kowi towah dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Amatni kowh dow sakraura, suira hai irsira mih amatni hown tawi tama bowk khowk. Amatni dow lusa kowi kowh uowi mih tawng chap paw tawi ka bak dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chownglawng mih apiawma sunah diah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />Naiawng rakowi awmrawmma hown cha chakkham diah, now kham grep tui diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng nachang kown mih Thurai nau en chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Atungma khup tawnguat iung diah, now phawk unsi hanow klangiungma uowi reng diah.<verse eid="ECC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />En kowh auan uowi dowi mih chownglawng ni maten kowi en sakrauah mih masi hown apiawma sunah diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow lusa kowi akawm akratma en uowi rakowi nami dow en kowh kakbak chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" />En rut kowi kowh lup uang ting mih srui en kowh kür maten hown changah diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowng kung kowi dow lup, sangkrangra, prengia hai chanlaira pami tawngpaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />Mukuang dak kowi ang plan khi ne tak mih dow iowm lenma miuüa taih nadowi atungma ka awmrawm sung, akürma miuüa taih nadowi atungma awng tasen, chanlaima miuüa taih nadowi atungma du pat chi ka cha, prengia chakma miuüa taih nadowi atungma kureng, now akiakma miuüa taih nadowi atungma lowra sia lang ka. Tawngplawng kowchow panow chownglawng kowi tawng ngai chow phaw mih dow akhin uang ting mih luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" />Kowmatia luk kowi phih nauang ting kown mih khin miapaw tuk dowi. Powk kowi kowh dam taia iawng hai leng kowi kowh uakling tasowk iawng lusa maru luk kowi mih linlanma sang phih uang ting reng.<verse eid="ECC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buala mih lak-e chanlai mih lang iung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Mukuang dak kowi kowh chanlaira lawnguan kowi ang sak kowi abüpma chuk lowk mih ang plan khi lowk. <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" />Marow chalachow mih uowi lowk chowdiah. Nami marow kowi maru uowi mih dow a-echow taih chekhai. Now nami marow kowi dow akürma mih mang lowk ia nauang senah kownkow uang rumta lut khai. <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />Now nami marow kowi mih ngaraichow mih maru chanlaima mih uowi lowk ia. Aia dow aia kowh chanlaira hown nami marow kowi hawt towkala khai. Tawkche nami ngaraichow mih maru kowi miapaw sak kowi towah dowi. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" />Ang tek mih, “Kür lak-e chanlaira lang iung,” pakhai. Tawkchedow ngaraichow mih maru kowh chanlaira dow maru nüah klowkah dowi, now aia kowh laiklow paw miapaw sünta pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" />Bualama mih pren kruitown mih kowh arangma mih laiklow lak-e dow chanlai miuüa kowh asamchow mih laiklow sünta mih lang iung. <verse eid="ECC 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" />Tasen müa rutchün khawkleng lak-e chanlaira lang iung. Tawkche maru ngak lowk ia dow aiung chap ahuma nowng piak chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Ving kowng mih su nam hown paingbawng apalang nowng piak chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:1">nami iawng bualara ditchow mih paw chanlaira hai ringkawra nowng piak chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Chanlaima mih maru dow tiama nowm kowi mang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:2">Tawkche bualama mih maru dow tiama tawi kowi mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />Bualama mih maru dow tiama kowi cham mang khe khowm aia <char style="w">buala</char> mih tüngla reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:3">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow bualama pami maru maten tukah reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />Pren kruitown mih kunmarau en chepaw en kowh rah mih hangkow nuata diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:4">saktuak klamma uowi hanow atawi ama huma chepaw aia mih nalawtta en kown taih.<verse eid="ECC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Mukuang dak kowi ang tut-e taka dowi mih ang khi pachap. Pren kruitown miuüa maiawng mih atawi ama chang reng chekhai: <verse eid="ECC 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" />Bualama miuüa kowi dow arah iuk iukma mih kowi towah khai, now kurengma miuüa kowi dow arah sowm sowmchow mih kowi towah khai. <verse eid="ECC 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" />Arah iukma mih maru iukuüa kowi dow khawk hown pe mangah hanow naruüa kowi dow kawrnga luk kowi pe chowmah mih paw ang khi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" />Thai kuam mih maru dow nami kuam kowi dowh chepaw naia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:8">now khue kimbang mih maru kowi dow rua chawtah chepaw naia kown.<verse eid="ECC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Hua hown chang lup mih maru dow hua hown ka arau chepaw naia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:9">now tu singh mih maru dow singh hown kla phih chepaw naia kown.<verse eid="ECC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Marek dow sükah dowi hanow atawng lang bowm reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:10">Nachenganchepaw chanlaira che tawngah hanow lup chawn reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />Rua kowi ia bia dowi rawn rua chawtta khai bowt hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:11">rua kowi tuk bia chepaw tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" />Chanlaima mih maru dow aia kowh laiklow rakowi ka ringkawra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:12">Tawkche bualama mih maru dow aia kowh laiklow rakowi aiamat piak reng.<verse eid="ECC 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />Bualama mih maru dow bualama mih laiklow hown uown prow sang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:13">now angakma hai thuklama mih laiklow hown aia kowh laiklow churah reng.<verse eid="ECC 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />Bualama mih maru dow achüt achütma chi tek lai reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:14">aia dow pur prakowi nauang ting kown mih lawnguanün tek reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:14">Tawkche pur prakowi tawng chow naown kown mih miapaw nowng tek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Bualama mih maru dow amatni kowh lup chang hown lainowmma bowm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:15">amatni dow bowm lai kowh kim prakowi mangla mih tiama khowm tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />Ngeuüachow mih maru chowm mang mih pren kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:16">Nami pren kowi kowh maru iukuüa dow rauchow hownia mur cha pawi reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />Nachenganchepaw maru iuk krungchak hownia kowh maru chowm mang mih pren dow prasira uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:17">Nami pren kowi kowh maru iukuüa dow pua müa nadowi kowi kür müa kowi akhin khe cha chakkham reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />Silikma mih maru kowh kimluk dow tapiak nak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:18">silik lai rakowi aia kowh kim kowi dow uang iat reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />Pawi chak hai arak kham dow sak kowi pe piawra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:19">now tangka pawisa dow lowra sia ia chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />Sakdawng hownia khowm padow mang kowi hang prawng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:20">now en mawk rah kim kowi khowm padow kureng miuüa kowi hang prawng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:20">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh laiklow mih uakling nacham iowla tarawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 10:20">now en kowh laiklow maten nami uakling nakowiowla hanow nakowtek pe tarawng.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="s">Prengia uowima mih maru kowh lup</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />En kowh tangka pawisa uowi mih lakke miuüa kowi kawklawma hown peah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:1">naiawng che en chang hanow en ngarai mih khin khe maru naplan pe en iawk kown.<verse eid="ECC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />En kowh tangka pawisa hown arah huma kowi cham krawi changla kun diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawng hownia chow phih nauang ting kown mih tukah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Uangnim kowi che tui atekma takrüm khowk hanow lusa kowi mih uangchak uang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:3">nami iawng mrawkphak pra lah, tawngphak pra lah singh dow tim hanow hing uowi hüah reng.<verse eid="ECC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Li iung uang iung kowi chawng mih maru dow ka sawt liu dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:4">now khin iung ni iung kowi chawng mih maru paw ka ngen luprak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />U mu lak kowi kowh ngeuüa tawng iawng chow hü sak mih en tuk dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:5">nami iawng lowra uanh thawp mih Thurai kowh lup paw en nowng tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />En kowh kan nuk hap liu mih rau pra hownia sat kowi pra krawi sawtah diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawng khe kowh chow nalang iung kown mih en tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lawngtang hai klanguüa vüi kowi kowh prengia iung</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Anowi dow lainowmma iung mih chap chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:7">khi sat hanow maru awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" />Naiawng rakowi ning huma sing mih maru dow ni towng pacham piaw lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:8">Tawkche akrat pusara ni paw ahuma uowi pami pacham tuakla reng lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow lusa kowi dow tawng sia paw nik dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />Klanguüa ow, en kowh klanguüa chowng apiawma sunah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:9">now en klanguüa reng tak khe en kowh sak mih pacham pe piaw en lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:9">En sak kowi nau mih iawng chang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:9">now en mik kowi iung mih iawng chang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:9">Nachenganchepaw mami laiklow tukah reng diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:9">en changah mih lup maten kowi Thurai mih nachet en tara kown.<verse eid="ECC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" />Naiawng rakowi hangkow tuak krat diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 11:10">now en kowh buk kow kowi paw hangkow towkah kawm diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow klanguüa chowng hai kür dow nik dowi chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="s">Thawp en miia kowi tukah reng diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />En kowh klanguüa chownglawng kowi thawp en miia kowi tukah reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en nalawngtang kown mih khin nauang ting kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:1">Nakhowk khe dow akawm akratma hown en nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:1">now en natek kown mih, “Lawngtang chowng kowi piawra uowi dowi lai le,” napa kown.<verse eid="ECC 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />Nami khin khe dow sat, lama hai krek nowi ün klimthupma en nakhi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:2">now uangchak uang kung kowi paw uangnim plan uowi mih en nakhi kown.<verse eid="ECC 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" />En towkala kow mih klowng nauak bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:3">now kawmat kowh akürma mih kumlawng paw natakui bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:3">En taila chakkham mih iüng paw a-echow towbowt nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:3">now en kowh mik paw achimma nakhi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:3">Naiawngün phaw dowi tak khe thawp en miia kowi tukla reng diah.<verse eid="ECC 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" />En kowh param paw tiama kowi kowh tünteu nata kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:4">now masiuüa mi tung tün paw en nata kaneu kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:4">Rau-e kowh uakling laiklow hown en nathowr bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:4">Nachenganchepaw plung tün hai meng tün dow en tut-e nasa bowt kown.<verse eid="ECC 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" />Nami khin khe dow alowngma mih rah kowi cham mang kown mih en nakram kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:5">now en lu kowi kowh sam paw anumma nauowi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:5">Cham mang cham kat chepaw lainowmma en nakawm bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:5">now en kowh naura hai prüara paw nauowi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:5">Nami kung kowi dow achowngma tadupra kuam kowi en namang bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:5">now uowila uiting uangtak miuüa tiama kowi mang iualua natawi sa en kown.<verse eid="ECC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" />Tai hown kowh leng tarai dowi rawn hai kuh hown kowh bia teu dowi rawn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:6">now tui chawt kowi tuikawng teu dowi rawn hai tuikuam kowi tui towng müa leng tarai dowi rawn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:6">thawp en miia kowi tukah reng diah.<verse eid="ECC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" />Bawn hown kowh thawpah mih en kowh buk dow bawn kowi naplan iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:7">now Thurai pe en mih lümla dow Thurai tut-e naplan iawk kown.<verse eid="ECC 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" />Naiawng rakowi prengia pek mih tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 12:8">“Tawng chap paw auan uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Achur laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />Prengia pek mih dow aiamat mih chanlaima chekhai, now aia dow maru kowi paw chanlaira lawnguan tüngsangla khai. Aia dow chanlaira laiklow maten tuakah kaneu hai chaingah kaneu hanow arasang towah khai. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Aia dow lahawm takama mih laiklow krawi cham khai, now aia ruiah mih laiklow maten dow achangma hai anowmma chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" />Chanlaima mih maru kowh laiklow dow ruapur thing mih kowh müa iawng chekhai. Amatni kowh laiklow dow pe arau chepaw khowng a-i reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Chapa ow, kaneu diah. Ang kowh laiklow kowi phai pe ching diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow cha dow rui reng chepaw chur dowi, now cha phat paw hu lai now kow uak reng chekhai.<verse eid="ECC 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />Kawmat dow ang tek mih maten en tuk bowk khowk. Tawkche achur kowi ang tek kown mih dow maiawng: Thurai kowi ringkawma hown kramah diah, now aia kowh ana pek maten chün diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng nachang kownkow Thurai thawp a-i mih chekhai. <verse eid="ECC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" />Thurai dow lusa maru changah mih lup maten luk kowi nachet tara kown. Aia dow lup iung hai lup ngak luk kowi ün nachet tara kown, now kukpa changah mih lup luk kowi khowm padow nachet tara kown.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>